OL,3,GNEWSAPaedophile jailed after being     
OL,4,Acaught by online decoy                 
OL,6,FThis article contains distressing      
OL,7,Fdetails                                
OL,9,FA repeat paedophile who thought he was 
OL,10,Farranging with a mother for him to rape
OL,11,Fher eight-year-old daughter has been   
OL,12,Fjailed for 16 years.                   
OL,14,FShaun Elliott, 35, went to a shopping  
OL,15,Fpark in Washington to meet the woman   
OL,16,Fbut was instead greeted by police,     
OL,17,Fhaving been caught by an online decoy  
OL,18,Foperation, Newcastle Crown Court heard.
